### Hent alle patienter
GET http://localhost:3000/api/patients

###

### Hent alle smerteregistreringer
GET http://localhost:3000/api/symptomregistreringer

###

### Opret en ny smerteregistrering
POST http://localhost:3000/api/symptomregistreringer
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "patient_id": 1,
    "smertetype": "Hovedpine",
    "beskrivelse": "Test af ny smerteregistrering",
    "smerteniveau": 6,
    "dato": "2026-11-06",
    "smertetyper": ["Dunkende", "Trykkende"],
    "smertelokation": "Panden",
    "starttid": "10:00",
    "slutdato": "2026-11-06",
    "sluttid": "12:00",
    "igangvaerende": false
}